sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Admin
    participant F as /admin/giris formu
    participant S as Slim API
    participant G as Supabase Auth
    A->>F: e-posta + sifre
    F->>S: POST /api/admin/login
    S->>G: signInWithPassword()
    G-->>S: access_token + user (admin mi?)
    S-->>F: 200 + Bearer token + Set-Cookie br_admin_token
    F->>F: token localStorage + /admin
    A->>S: GET /admin (cookie)
    S-->>A: 200 dashboard (yoksa 302 /admin/giris)
    A->>S: GET /api/admin/* (Bearer)
    S-->>A: 200 JSON (yoksa 401)
